cat >> "$report" <<'"'EOF'

Default O2 saved 8,038 instructions and default speed saved 8,644. Tuned O2 saved 5,164 and tuned speed saved 5,883. No measured project rose in any of the four comparisons.

## Framework scope and evidence limits

The Typed range analysis uses the existing framework lattice, edge transfer, solver and pass dependency declarations. The BCE edits use the normal transaction and correspondence mechanism, and Horner uses the existing table compiler. There were no changes under "'`src/framework/`. The new proof case belongs to Typed'"'s existing rule verifier, where the semantics of its i32 operators are known.

The emulator measurements establish instruction counts, the before-and-after comparisons and step deltas. The meaning checks and reference comparisons establish agreement for the stated samples. The unsigned range argument and the scope of its transfer to all valid bound checks follow from interval containment and control-flow semantics. The Horner equivalence is proved by the verifier and independently exercised by the sampled pass check. Instruction counts for other regex inputs, general masked hashes and wall-clock speed were outside the measurement.

## Later

- Repair the stale-value-ID failure in late LVN before considering that schedule.
- Add a rule grammar guard for interchangeable bases and masks if more corpus examples justify it.
EOF
